#: ../../source/benchmarking.rst:2 caf14f4627264c30814b6d1b9033dea7
msgid "Benchmarking with asv"
msgstr "使用 asv 进行基准测试"

#: ../../source/benchmarking.rst:4 41e0414a321f423793c56147fccd3f3d
msgid ""
"PyBroker uses `asv (Airspeed Velocity) <https://asv.readthedocs.io/>`_ to"
" track backtest performance across commits. asv runs benchmarks, stores "
"per-commit results under ``.asv/results/``, and produces an HTML "
"dashboard for visual regression tracking."
msgstr ""
"PyBroker 使用 `asv（Airspeed Velocity） <https://asv.readthedocs.io/>`_ 跨"
"提交跟踪回测性能。asv 运行基准测试，将每次提交的结果存储在 "
"``.asv/results/`` 下，并生成用于可视化回归跟踪的 HTML 仪表盘。"

#: ../../source/benchmarking.rst:9 53a83a11fbc74ea2bd83846c867ee2e7
msgid ""
"The benchmark suite lives in ``benchmarks/`` and is exercised in CI on "
"every pull request via ``.github/workflows/asv-pr.yml`` (uses ``asv "
"continuous origin/master HEAD`` and posts a sticky PR comment with the "
"diff)."
msgstr ""
"基准测试套件位于 ``benchmarks/`` 目录下，并通过 "
"``.github/workflows/asv-pr.yml`` 在每个 pull request 的 CI 中执行（使用 "
"``asv continuous origin/master HEAD``，并在 PR 中发布一条置顶评论显示"
"差异）。"

